        <h1 class="post-detail__title">AED and CPR Courses to Better Protect the Community</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/50840.webp" alt="AED and CPR Courses to Better Protect the Community" loading="lazy">
